12
00:00:38,091 --> 00:00:39,886
Sketch two boxes.

13
00:00:39,940 --> 00:00:45,008
The first is the client, such as Visual
Studio Code or a CLI in the corporate

14
00:00:45,062 --> 00:00:46,527
