setup.

20
00:01:04,547 --> 00:01:07,852
The machine that runs the client tells
you one part of that story.

21
00:01:08,521 --> 00:01:12,860
If you cannot name the configured
destination, keep the real source out of

22
00:01:12,887 --> 00:01:15,300
